      "instance_name": "thanksgiving_dinner_scene",
      "label": "Thanksgiving dinner gathering",
      "description": "A communal Thanksgiving dinner scene featuring multiple people (represented by their hands and arms) gathered around a table laden with traditional American Thanksgiving foods including a roasted turkey, corn on the cob, green beans, salad, and other dishes. The scene is framed from an overhead perspective, emphasizing the shared meal and interaction. The text 'thanksgiving in china' is overlaid, creating a satirical or humorous context.",
