      "instance_name": "stereotype_china_not_celebrating_thanksgiving",
      "label": "Stereotype: China Does Not Celebrate Thanksgiving",
      "description": "A common stereotype that Chinese people do not recognize or celebrate Western holidays. This meme relies on this stereotype to create humor by implying that Thanksgiving is an 'alien' concept in China, which may be seen as culturally insensitive or reductive.",
