      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_74c9d217",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience is individuals familiar with both American Thanksgiving traditions and Chinese cultural context, likely Western audiences who understand the cultural mismatch being highlighted. The meme relies on the audience's recognition of Thanksgiving as an American holiday and China's lack of celebration of it, making it humorous or satirical to those who perceive the juxtaposition as absurd. The audience is likely to include internet users who appreciate cultural satire or irony, particularly those who are aware of the stereotype that Chinese people do not celebrate Western holidays. The meme may also target those who enjoy memes that play on cultural misunderstandings or exoticize foreign cultures for comedic effect.",
